part b_market
  tally 1
  note "Market data the asks read (tmp/cases/market). Bank Lazur's exchange table: a CSV with a title line, ';' and decimal commas (O:B-1), so the days read are written out. DUKOR 6M fixings, in percent, for the mortgage's resets (B-D07 .2)."

input lazur_buy: num DUK/FLR question "What is Bank Lazur's buy rate for florens on this day (B-D23 §4)?"

input dukor_6m: num question "What is the DUKOR 6M fixing of this day, in percent (B-D07 .2)?"

version lazur_table_2025
  cite b_market
  known 2026-01-07
  note "Each rate is known on its own day; one version known at the cut keeps the file short, and the asks that read a rate on its own day (B-10's replay) pin the balance, not the rate."
